Estimate: the center bowl holds oatmeal or porridge, roughly 250 g, at about 70 kcal per 100 g, so about 175 kcal. The bowls on the left hold raspberries and blackberries and are only partly in frame. I'll assume about 60 g of raspberries (about 31 kcal) and 50 g of blackberries (about 22 kcal).

Total mass is 250 + 60 + 50 = 360 g. Total energy is 175 + 31 + 22 = 228 kcal, which I'll round to 230.

